# Workspace registry codegen modularization (Phase G)

Phase G splits the monolithic `scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs` (~4,100 lines, 50+ output keys) into **domain modules** under `scripts/codegen/workspace-registry/` while preserving **byte-identical** generated artifacts until each slice is verified.

**Authority:** [platform-architecture-v2.md § Phase G](../architecture/platform-architecture-v2.md#phase-g--codegen-modularization) · **Baseline outputs:** [10.2-manifest-codegen.md](../phase-10/subphases/10.2-manifest-codegen.md)

## Problem

| Symptom | Risk at 100 workspaces |
| ------- | ---------------------- |
| Single file owns discovery, validation, 50+ emitters, path map, CLI | Merge conflicts, slow review, opaque ownership |
| One global `--check` compares all outputs | CI cannot pin failures to a domain |
| Member portal presets live in sibling script | Parallel registry pattern (Phase B debt) |

The generator **works** and is **manifest-driven**; the monolith is a **scale and maintainability** bottleneck, not a correctness bug.

## Non-goals (Phase G)

- Changing manifest schema or generated TypeScript shapes
- Merging `member-portal-contract-codegen.mjs` (adjacent; optional G4+)
- DTCG C1–C3 admin dark palette gating ([dtcg-pipeline-spec.mdoc § C1–C3](dtcg-pipeline-spec.mdoc)) — optional later slice

## Target layout

```text
scripts/
  generate-workspace-registry.mjs     # thin entry + re-exports (G3 ✅)
  member-portal-contract-codegen.mjs  # G4 — re-export shim → domains/member-portal.mjs
  codegen/
    workspace-registry/
      constants.mjs                   # REPO_ROOT, BANNER, locales
      manifest-loader.mjs             # discoverManifests
      validation.mjs                  # assert* pre-emit gates
      utils.mjs                       # importSpecifier, const prefixes
      orchestrator.mjs                # generateAllOutputs, OUTPUT_PATHS, CLI (G3 ✅)
      domains/
        core-registry.mjs             # sdk, api, web loaders (G2)
        tour-api.mjs                  # tour write, canonical, outbox (G2)
        wizard-admin.mjs              # wizard surfaces, media, chrome, rules (G2)
        theme.mjs                     # admin + guest theme loaders (G2)
        guest-catalog.mjs             # catalog paths, presentation, SEO, landing (G2)
        registration.mjs              # catalog registration + intake (G2)
        member.mjs                    # profile capabilities (G2)
        member-portal.mjs             # portal contracts, surfaces, presets (G4)
        http-routes.mjs               # routes, handler loaders, error map (G2)
        settings-api.mjs              # enrichers, dev bootstrap (G2)
        dev.mjs                       # dev plugin tenant map (G2)
        operator.mjs                  # operator capabilities (G2)
```

**Import rule:** Domain modules may import `constants`, `manifest-loader`, `validation`, `utils`, and L3 types only via string templates — **no** imports from `packages/workspaces/*` or `apps/*`.

## Slice plan

| Slice | Scope | Exit criteria |
| ----- | ----- | ------------- |
| **G0 (doc)** | This document + 10.2 cross-link + architecture § Phase G detail | Architect review |
| **G1** | `constants`, `manifest-loader`, `validation`, `utils`; orchestrator imports them; **re-export** public API from entry script | `generate:workspace-registry` + `--check` PASS; drop-in spec green |
| **G2** | Move emitters into `domains/*.mjs` one domain at a time | Per-domain unit assertions in drop-in spec; no diff in `*.generated.ts` |
| **G3** | `orchestrator.mjs` owns `OUTPUT_PATHS`, `generateAllOutputs`, `runWorkspaceRegistryCli()`; per-domain `--check` | ✅ `guard:workspace-registry-fresh` + `guard:workspace-registry-domain-*` scripts |
| **G4** | Fold member-portal into `domains/member-portal.mjs`; shim at legacy path | ✅ |

## Domain → output map

Each row is one future `--check --domain=<id>` boundary. Keys match `generateAllOutputs()` return properties.

| Domain id | Output keys | Primary consumers |
| --------- | ----------- | ------------------- |
| `core-registry` | `sdk`, `api`, `web` | workspace-sdk bindings, API plugin registry, web plugin loaders |
| `tour-api` | `tourWrite`, `canonicalTour`, `outbox` | apps/api tours + workspace outbox |
| `wizard-admin` | `wizardMedia`, `wizardMediaRoutes`, `wizardMediaBackendRoutes`, `wizardSurfaces`, `wizardLabels`, `wizardI18nTranslators`, `workspaceWizardMessages`, `wizardCloneRemint`, `wizardCreate`, `wizardTemplateEditorBindings`, `marketingCatalogBindings`, `settingsDestinationBindings`, `settingsEquipmentUiBindings`, `tourActionSubmitBindings`, `photoUploadErrorsBindings`, `tourListCategoryBindings`, `operatorUiComponentsBindings`, `wizardDraftUnificationBindings`, `wizardRulesBindings`, `wizardTemplatePresetBindings`, `wizardDraftShellBindings`, `wizardCreateChromeBindings`, `wizardFlatEditChromeBindings`, `wizardFlatEditFormBindings`, `wizardFlatEditPageBindings`, `wizardCreateViewBindings`, `wizardCompositeRegistryBindings`, `settingsHubFallbackBindings` | apps/web bootstrap |
| `theme` | `themeStylesheets`, `guestThemeStylesheetsPortal`, `guestThemeStylesheetsMarketing` | web / portal / marketing theme loaders |
| `guest-catalog` | `catalogPaths`, `catalogListFeatures`, `catalogDetailSections`, `guestConformance`, `guestSeo`, `guestLanding`, `guestCrossSurfaceNav` | workspace-sdk catalog + guest-surface-host |
| `registration` | `workspaceIntakePlugins`, `registrationFlowPlugins`, `registrationTransportInitializers` | workspace-plugin-host |
| `member` | `memberProfileCapabilities`, `memberPortalContracts`, `memberPortalSurfaces` | workspace-sdk portal (contracts via sibling script) |
| `http` | `httpRoutes`, `httpHandlerLoaders`, `httpErrorMap` | apps/api http + middleware |
| `settings-api` | `settingsEnrichers`, `devBootstrap` | apps/api settings |
| `dev` | `devPluginIds` | guest-surface-host dev map |
| `operator` | `operatorCapabilities` | workspace-sdk operator |

## Pre-emit validation (shared)

These run in orchestrator **before** any domain emit (order preserved):

1. `discoverManifests()` — required manifest fields
2. `assertMemberPortalL4ReferenceWorkspaces()` — sibling script
3. `assertWizardI18nAssets()` — wizard.json locale files
4. `assertManifestWebModules()` — package export paths for wizard surfaces
5. Per-manifest in `generateAllOutputs`: `assertGuestExtensionsManifest`, `assertHttpRoutesManifest`

Domain-specific `assert*` functions stay co-located with their emitters in G2 (e.g. `assertCatalogPresentationManifest` → `guest-catalog.mjs`).

## Per-domain `--check` (G3)

Full check (all 50+ output keys):

```bash
pnpm run guard:workspace-registry-fresh   # node scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs --check
```

Scoped check (subset via `DOMAIN_OUTPUT_KEYS` in `orchestrator.mjs`):

```bash
node scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs --check --domain=wizard-admin
node scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs --check --domain=guest-catalog
pnpm run guard:workspace-registry-domain-guest-catalog   # npm alias
```

Check mode still runs **all** pre-emit validation (`discoverManifests`, member-portal L4 gate, wizard i18n, web modules) and calls `generateAllOutputs()` once; only the **on-disk comparison** is scoped to the domain’s output keys. Unknown `--domain=` values throw with the sorted valid id list.

Write mode honors `--domain=` the same way (regenerates only that domain’s files).

```javascript
// orchestrator.mjs — resolveOutputKeys(domainId) → OUTPUT_KEYS | DOMAIN_OUTPUT_KEYS[id]
for (const key of keysToSync) {
  if (onDisk[key] !== generated[key]) mismatches.push(OUTPUT_PATHS[key]);
}
```

CI wiring:

| Script | When |
| ------ | ---- |
| `guard:workspace-registry-fresh` | pre-commit fast-track, phase-6 guard (unchanged alias) |
| `guard:workspace-registry-domain-<id>` | optional parallel CI / local iteration per domain |

Valid domain ids: `core-registry`, `tour-api`, `wizard-admin`, `theme`, `guest-catalog`, `registration`, `member`, `http`, `settings-api`, `dev`, `operator`.

## Backward compatibility

- **Entry point** remains `scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs` (~207 lines: imports + re-exports + CLI delegate)
- **Orchestrator** `scripts/codegen/workspace-registry/orchestrator.mjs` (~568 lines): `OUTPUT_PATHS`, `OUTPUT_KEYS`, `DOMAIN_OUTPUT_KEYS`, `generateAllOutputs`, `runWorkspaceRegistryCli`
- **Public exports** used by `scripts/test/workspace-registry-drop-in.spec.mjs` remain on the entry re-export surface
- **Banner** string unchanged: `AUTO-GENERATED by scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs` (cosmetic subpath comment deferred)

## Verification (each slice)

```bash
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
pnpm run guard:workspace-registry-fresh
node --test scripts/test/workspace-registry-drop-in.spec.mjs
pnpm run phase-6:fast-track
pnpm run test:changed
```

Full monorepo gate (`ci:integrity`) deferred until Phase G closure PR — same policy as Phase F.

